 potions are used to fullfil quests)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455710/extras/ea68f6a3ff5a098efc5a1f2fc991117f.poster.avif?t=1754412048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455710/extras/ea68f6a3ff5a098efc5a1f2fc991117f.webm?t=1754412048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455710/extras/ea68f6a3ff5a098efc5a1f2fc991117f.mp4?t=1754412048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will <strong>NOT include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming sim rudiments like fishing, mining, leveling, stamina, health or combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life sim features like dating or building your own house! (you can decorate your garden though!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (and we are sorry for that)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike deckbuilding (but the game comes with a frustratingly hard card minigame called Ershiyi - maybe that's something for you then!!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These lists are here as a disclaimer because we are a small two-people selfpublishing indie dev studio and Golembert is our first game. We will do everything to deliver you the game presented here. But some things (like all the points of the NOT included-list) are beyond our vision, possibilities, and/or capabilities. Please keep that in mind! :)        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455710/extras/5b9c3f57ab1a5feff9a97495022e35e1.avif?t=1754412048\" /></span>